# ============================================================
# PROJECT      : ALPHAEDGE — Momentum+Carry Forex Trading Bot
# FILE         : .env.example
# DESCRIPTION  : Environment variable template (copy to .env)
# AUTHOR       : ALPHAEDGE Dev Team
# WORKFLOW     : VSCode + Claude + Copilot Pro + File Engineering
